# ═══ LUCID WINDS .gitignore ═══

# Node — dev-only verification tools (jsdom, puppeteer, sharp).
# Live game is single-file vanilla JS per CLAUDE.md rule #1, no
# framework, no build system. These files exist only because dev
# verification scripts npm-install things locally.
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
# ⛔ ...but a BARE `package.json` matches at EVERY level, and it was quietly
# swallowing store/jimothy-steam/package.json — which is not dev tooling, it is
# the Steam BUILD RECIPE (productName, appId, the icon path, the
# electron-builder targets). It was one lost codespace away from gone, with the
# build upload still ahead of us. Track that one.
!store/jimothy-steam/package.json

# Minify build artifact — generated by scripts/minify.js, not committed
index.min.html

# Source art — large PNGs from Gemini/Canva/screenshots (not deployed).
# Recursive patterns since Stephen drops sources into multiple subdirs
# (assets/games/cards/, assets/nursery/, assets/decks/OG/, etc).
assets/Gemini_Generated_Image_*
assets/**/Gemini_Generated_Image_*
**/Gemini_Generated_Image_*
assets/Take a look at my Canva design*
assets/1774756*
assets/1774977*
assets/1775322*
assets/Screenshot_*
Screenshot_*
# iPhone/Android screenshot naming variants with spaces + parens like
# "Screenshot (May 9, 2026 11_17_50 AM).png" — drop in as bug repros,
# never commit.
assets/Screenshot (*
"Screenshot (*"
# Galaxy / Samsung default screenshot filenames (10000XXXXX.jpg)
assets/1000*.jpg
1000*.jpg
# Pixel / iPhone default screenshot filenames
assets/IMG_*
IMG_*
assets/PXL_*
PXL_*

# Art drop archives — extract + wire + delete. Never commit.
assets/*.zip
assets/**/*.zip
assets/*-unzipped/
assets/**/*-unzipped/

# Raw Midjourney UUID-named dumps — always rename + cutout before committing.
# Recursive patterns since these get dropped into many subdirs.
assets/Stephenuffugus_*
assets/**/Stephenuffugus_*
**/Stephenuffugus_*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Environment
.env
.env.local

# Stripe secret config — lives on the server only, NEVER committed
stripe-config.php
# Feedback delivery config (designated email) — server only, NEVER committed
feedback-config.php
.claude/worktrees/
.tmp_sim/

# Raw sprite sheets. These USED to be ignored ("source; cut assets ship instead"), but
# that silently ate anything dropped in art-drop/ — sheets pushed from a phone never
# arrived, and Nectar Drop's 64MB of source sheets survive only on one codespace disk.
# Director's call (2026-07-13): keep the sources in the repo so they are not lost.
# Still ignore the throwaway working copies.
satellites/*/art-drop/**/*.tmp.png
satellites/*/art-drop/**/cut/

# ── Session hygiene (2026-07-11) ──
# Art-drop + handoff archives land in many dirs (root, satellites/*, satellites/*/assets).
# Same rule as assets/*.zip above: extract, wire, delete — never commit. 0 zips tracked
# repo-wide, so this global pattern is safe.
*.zip
# Scratch probe/debug scripts dropped at repo root during a session.
scratchpad_*

# pinball claymation derived (re-derivable via scripts/cut_pinball_claymation.py)
satellites/greenhouse-pinball/art-drop/*/cut/
satellites/greenhouse-pinball/art-drop/*/thumbs/
satellites/greenhouse-pinball/art-drop/*/MONTAGE.png
scripts/__pycache__/
publish/build/
scratch-steam/
store/jimothy-steam/steampipe/generated/

# card back exploration scratch (four SVG options that lost to the real art)
scratch/

# audit packet progress (local, regenerable)
scripts/.audit_packet_state.json

# Backed up 2026-08-23 as RELEASE ASSETS on the private repo
# Stephenuffugus/lucid-winds-vault, tag vault-20260823 (round-trip verified,
# SHA256SUMS.txt in the release). Restore: gh release download vault-20260823
# -R Stephenuffugus/lucid-winds-vault. Neither belongs in this PUBLIC 3.3 GB repo.
#   steamart/          51839266 bytes. 16/21 files are byte-identical to tracked
#                      store/jimothy-steam/capsules/out/*; the unique part is the
#                      Valve submission zip, which is in the vault tar.
#   dist/whim-jimothy/ 44668389 bytes. Re-derivable: scripts/whim_jimothy_build.sh.
#                      The upload zips it produces are in the vault.
# Ignored paths are what `git clean -x` deletes, so still never run it here.
steamart/
dist/whim-jimothy/

# FTW raw art sheets. 42 MB of 2 MB PNGs. The originals live in Stephen's Drive
# (Github > FTW > Assets) and a second copy is a release asset on the private
# lucid-winds-vault repo, so nothing here is a sole copy. The CUT icons in
# satellites/flock-the-world/art/ are committed; these generators' outputs are not.
satellites/flock-the-world/art-drop/
art-asset-lists/Assets-*.zip
